> Sofa Direct is your online destination for stylish, comfortable, and affordable sofas and living room furniture. Explore a wide range of fabric and leather sofas, corner sofas, recliners, sofa beds, and modern designs for every home. We focus on quality, comfort, and value, offering fast UK delivery and a smooth shopping experience to help you create your perfect living space.

Welcome to Sofa Direct, your trusted online destination for high-quality, stylish, and affordable sofas designed to transform every living space. We specialise in a wide range of fabric and leather sofas, corner sofas, recliners, sofa beds, and modern living room furniture to suit homes of all sizes and styles.

At Sofa Direct, we work directly with manufacturers, allowing us to offer exceptional value without compromising on quality. Our strong supply network ensures that many of our in-stock sofas are available for fast dispatch and delivery, getting your new furniture to you quickly and efficiently.

We are proud to offer nationwide delivery with a room-of-choice service, meaning your sofa is delivered exactly where you need it in your home for maximum convenience. Our streamlined logistics and supplier partnerships allow us to provide fast turnaround times, with most orders delivered within 2–7 working days on in-stock items.

Whether you’re upgrading your living room, furnishing a new home, or replacing an old sofa, Sofa Direct makes the process simple, reliable, and stress-free. With a focus on comfort, quality, and customer satisfaction, we are committed to helping you create the perfect space with furniture you’ll love for years to come.

